# .mailmap — canonical author identities for this repository.
#
# Git consults this file for `git log`, `git shortlog`, `git blame` and GitHub's
# contributor views. It changes how identities are DISPLAYED; it does not
# rewrite any commit object, so every SHA, tag, submodule pointer and archived
# release remains valid.
#
# Format:  Proper Name <proper@email> Commit Name <commit@email>
#          Proper Name <proper@email> <commit@email>          (match by e-mail only)
#
# Verify with:
#     git shortlog -sne --all
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Corporate address used on 8 early commits (2025-02-05 .. 2025-07-17),
# remapped to the author's academic address.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Yutaro Nakagama <ynakagama@jaist.ac.jp> <Yutaro.Nakagama@bosch.com>
